      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I recently had an incredible experience with GreenGen Solar for the installation of my solar panel and battery system, and I couldn’t be happier! From start to finish, their team was professional, knowledgeable, and dedicated to delivering top-notch service.Detailed & Transparent Quotation:Right from the initial consultation, GreenGen Solar provided an excellent, detailed quotation that broke down every aspect of the system, including panel efficiency, battery storage capacity, and expected energy savings. They took the time to answer all my questions, explaining the process, costs, and long-term benefits in a way that was easy to understand.Expert Guidance on Rebates & Incentives:One of the biggest highlights was their amazing help in securing all available rebates and incentives. They walked me through every step, ensuring I maximized my savings through government schemes and solar credits. Their expertise in this area alone saved me a significant amount of money!Punctual & Professional Installation:The installation team was punctual, efficient, and respectful of my property. They worked diligently, kept the worksite neat and tidy, and completed the job without any delays. The final installation is clean, sleek, and perfectly optimized for maximum energy production.Exceptional Customer Service:Throughout the entire process, GreenGen Solar maintained clear communication, providing updates and addressing any concerns promptly. Their commitment to customer satisfaction is truly outstanding.If you’re looking for a reliable, professional, and highly skilled solar installer, I wholeheartedly recommend GreenGen Solar. They exceeded my expectations in every way, and I’m thrilled with my new solar energy system!Thank you, GreenGen Solar – you’ve earned a loyal customer",
